      "date_text": "September 30, 2026",
      "end_text": null,
      "excerpt": "The Useful and Beautiful Art Prize is a new award established by the William Morris Society to celebrate and support emerging artists, designers, and craftspeople whose work reflects the ideas and ideals of William Morris. The Prize is guided by Morris’s belief that art is both Useful and Beautiful, inseparable from everyday life, work, and nature. Entry opens 15th July 2026 and closes",
      "image_url": "https://williammorrissociety.org/wp-content/uploads/Untitled-design-1-e1789125756839.jpg",
